---
import '@fontsource-variable/archivo/wdth.css'; import '@fontsource/dm-mono/400.css'; import SecondaryMasthead from '../../components/SecondaryMasthead.astro';
import { personSchema, siteUrl } from '../../data/seo';

const title = 'About Dave Bettner | Customer-facing technical delivery';
const description =
  'Dave Bettner on staying close to the customer: the throughline between the people using a system and the engineers building it, from financial reporting to public agent engineering.';
const canonical = `${siteUrl}/about/`;
---
<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head>
  <meta charset="utf-8"/>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/>
  <meta name="description" content={description}/>
  <meta name="robots" content="index, follow"/>
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#08090b"/>
  <meta name="color-scheme" content="dark"/>
  <link rel="canonical" href={canonical}/>
  <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml"/>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles/interstellar-system.css"/>
  <meta property="og:type" content="profile"/>
  <meta property="og:title" content={title}/>
  <meta property="og:description" content={description}/>
  <meta property="og:url" content={canonical}/>
  <meta property="og:image" content={`${siteUrl}/images/dave-bettner-og.jpg`}/>
  <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"/>
  <meta name="twitter:title" content={title}/>
  <meta name="twitter:description" content={description}/>
  <meta name="twitter:image" content={`${siteUrl}/images/dave-bettner-og.jpg`}/>
  <script is:inline type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(personSchema)}></script>
  <title>{title}</title>
</head><body><a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a><SecondaryMasthead context="About · operator profile"/><main id="main"><section class="about-warm"><div class="wrap about-grid"><div><h1>I like work that keeps me close to the customer.</h1><p class="lead">Most of my career has been spent between the people using a system and the engineers building it.</p></div><figure><img src="/images/dave-bettner-headshot-20260816-cutout.png" alt="Dave Bettner in a gray suit and navy tie" width="1312" height="1199"/></figure></div></section><section class="about-body"><div class="wrap"><blockquote class="field-note"><p>On one reporting implementation, data had to move both ways between the reporting platform and the system of record. The technical connection was only part of the job. Finance, IT, and executives still needed an audit trail, clear ownership, and a sign-off they could trust.</p><cite>A lesson from the handoff</cite></blockquote><p>I started in financial reporting, then moved into solutions architecture, healthcare integrations, and broader implementation work. The industries changed, but the job stayed similar: learn the workflow, make the technical path clear, and help the team get it into use.</p><p>Outside client work, I build public tools and labs because working code forces better decisions than a slide deck does.</p></div></section><section class="about-close"><div class="wrap"><h2>See the work.</h2><nav><a href="/work/">Work</a><a href="/experience/">Experience</a><a href="/fit/">Field approach</a><a href="/#contact">Contact</a></nav></div></section></main><script is:inline type="module" src="/interstellar.js"></script></body></html>
<style is:global>
.about-warm{background:#151412;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule)}.about-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr .72fr;gap:clamp(30px,7vw,100px);align-items:center;padding:clamp(50px,9vw,120px) 0}.eyebrow{color:var(--orange)}h1{max-width:14ch;font-size:clamp(2.6rem,5vw,5rem);margin:14px 0}.lead{max-width:48ch;color:var(--muted);font-size:1.1rem}.about-grid figure{margin:0;align-self:end;overflow:hidden}.about-grid img{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;max-height:620px;object-fit:contain;object-position:center bottom;filter:drop-shadow(0 20px 32px rgba(0,0,0,.28));-webkit-mask-image:linear-gradient(to bottom,#000 0,#000 92%,transparent 100%);mask-image:linear-gradient(to bottom,#000 0,#000 92%,transparent 100%)}.about-body{padding:clamp(45px,8vw,100px) 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule)}.field-note{margin:0 0 clamp(42px,7vw,78px);padding:28px 0;border-block:1px solid var(--rule);max-width:66ch}.field-note p{font-size:clamp(1.3rem,2.2vw,1.85rem)!important;line-height:1.35;letter-spacing:-.015em}.field-note cite{display:block;color:var(--orange);font:500 .75rem 'DM Mono',monospace;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.04em}.about-body p{max-width:62ch;font-size:1.08rem;margin-bottom:22px}.about-body p:last-child{margin-bottom:0}.about-close{padding:50px 0 80px}.about-close h2{margin:12px 0 22px}.about-close nav{display:flex;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap}.about-close nav a{min-height:44px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:4px}@media(max-width:700px){.wrap{width:calc(100% - 28px)}.about-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.about-grid figure{max-width:360px}}
</style>